Appendix D: Glossary

Bio-inspired: Design principles based on biological systems
Capability-based security: Security model based on capabilities rather than identities
Consciousness: State of awareness and subjective experience
Corrigibility: Ability to be corrected or modified
Emergent behavior: Behavior arising from interactions of components
Global workspace: Theoretical model of consciousness
Meta-cognition: Thinking about thinking
Pheromone: Chemical signal used for communication in biological systems
Stigmergy: Indirect coordination through environment modification
Theory of mind: Understanding others' mental states
Value alignment: Ensuring AI systems share human values

